# Wrapper jar should usually be committed, but sometimes ignored depending on policy. 
# Including it is standard practice, but avoiding executing binaries is also common. 
# I will not ignore the wrapper jar, but ignore local overrides
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!maven-wrapper.properties

