CLAUDE.md

# Internal working notes - never committed (user directive 2026-07-03)
docs/

# --- Scratch that keeps landing in the repo ROOT ---
# Screenshots, scratch downloads and hand-pulled data dumps taken while working.
# Root-anchored on purpose: a legitimate .jpg or .csv inside a module's
# resources must stay committable.
/Screenshot*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/buba.csv
/fn-adhoc.xml

# --- Local UI prototypes ---
# These live INSIDE src/main/resources, which the IDE section above un-ignores
# wholesale (`!**/src/main/resources/**`). Git takes the LAST matching pattern,
# so these lines must stay below that negation to have any effect - verify with
# `git check-ignore -v <path>` after touching either place. The `_`-prefixed
# Leitstand drafts are local sketches; they must never ship in the jar.
/terminal/src/main/resources/web/_preview.html
/terminal/src/main/resources/web/_preview2.html
